msgstr "skakel tussen die moontlikheid aan uitvee die gekose stensils"

#: rc.cpp:132
msgid "Export Page"
msgstr "voer uit bladsy"

#: rc.cpp:133
msgid "&Quality:"
msgstr "kwaliteit:"

#: rc.cpp:134
msgid "&Border:"
msgstr "grens:"

#: rc.cpp:136
msgid "C&rop picture to edges"
msgstr "afknip prent aan randte"

#: rc.cpp:137
msgid "Don't export extra blank space to file"
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:138
msgid ""
"<b>Crop picture to edges</b><br>\n"
"This will eliminate all blank portions of the drawing. The picture will only "
"be as large as the stencils it contains. If your stencils are located in the "
"upper right corner of the page, then only the upper right corner will be "
"exported."
msgstr ""
"<b>afknip prent aan randte</b><br>\n"
"hierdie sal elimineer alle leë porsies van die teken. die prent sal slegs "
"wees as groot as die stensils dit bevat. as jou stensils word geleë in die "
"boonste regterkant hoek van die bladsy, dan word slegs die boonste "
"regterkant hoek sal wees uitgevoer word."

#: rc.cpp:139
msgid "&Selected stencils"
msgstr "gekose stensils"

#: rc.cpp:140
msgid "Export the selected stencils on the current page"
msgstr "voer uit die gekose stensils op die huidige bladsy"

#: rc.cpp:141
msgid ""
"<b>Selected Stencils</b><br>\n"
"Export only the selected stencils to file."
msgstr ""
"<b>gekose stensils</b><br>\n"
"voer uit slegs die gekose stensils aan lêer."

#: rc.cpp:142
msgid "&All stencils"
msgstr "alle stensils"

#: rc.cpp:143
msgid "Export all stencils on the current page"
msgstr "voer uit alle stensils op die huidige bladsy"

#: rc.cpp:144
msgid ""
"<b>All Stencils</b><br>\n"
"This will cause the entire page to be exported to the file. This means that "
"<i>all</i> stencils will be exported."
msgstr ""
"<b>alle stensils</b><br>\n"
"hierdie sal veroorsaak die hele bladsy aan wees uitgevoer word aan die "
"lêer. hierdie beteken wat <i>alle</i> stensils sal wees uitgevoer word."

#: rc.cpp:145
msgid "The higher the quality, the more space the file takes up."
msgstr "die hoër die kwaliteit, die meer spasie die lêer neem begin."

#: rc.cpp:146
msgid ""
"<b>Quality</b><br>\n"
"Not all file formats use this. But for those that do, this affects the "
"quality of the image that gets exported. 100 is the maximum quality. The "
"higher the number, the better the picture looks. The downside is the higher "
"the number, the larger the filesize."
msgstr ""
"<b>kwaliteit</b><br>\n"
"nie alle lêer formate gebruik hierdie. maar vir daardie wat doen, hierdie "
"affekteer die kwaliteit van die beeld wat besit uitgevoer word. 100 is die "
"maksimum kwaliteit. die hoër die nommer, die beter die prent kyk. die "
"nadeel is die hoër die nommer, die grootter die lêer grootte."

#: rc.cpp:147
msgid "An optional border of whitespace around the page, in pixels"
msgstr "'n opsionele grens van spasie omtrent die bladsy, in beeld elemente"

#: rc.cpp:148
msgid ""
"<b>Border</b><br>\n"
"Places a blank border around the edges of the image. This can be used if for "
"one reason or another, the stencils don't fit into the export page with a "
"0-pixel border (default)."
msgstr ""

#: rc.cpp:150
msgid ""
"<b>Cancel</b><br>\n"
"Abort the page export."
msgstr ""
"<b>kanseleer</b><br>\n"
"staak die bladsy voer uit."

#: rc.cpp:151
msgid "&Ok"
msgstr "goed"

#: rc.cpp:152
msgid ""
"<b>Ok</b><br>\n"
"Export the page with the current settings."
msgstr ""
"<b>goed</b><br>\n"
"voer uit die bladsy met die huidige instellings."

